eed, we think you are among the liars.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":186,"sd":null},{"k":"26:187","t":"So cause to fall upon us fragments of the sky, if you should be of the truthful.\"","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":187,"sd":null},{"k":"26:188","t":"He said, \"My Lord is most knowing of what you do.\"","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":188,"sd":null},{"k":"26:189","t":"And they denied him, so the punishment of the day of the black cloud seized them. Indeed, it was the punishment of a terrible day.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":189,"sd":null},{"k":"26:190","t":"Indeed in that is a sign, but most of them were not to be believers.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":190,"sd":null},{"k":"26:191","t":"And indeed, your Lord - He is the Exalted in Might, the Merciful.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":191,"sd":null},{"k":"26:192","t":"And indeed, it [i.e., the Qur’ān] is the revelation of the Lord of the worlds.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":192,"sd":null},{"k":"26:193","t":"The Trustworthy Spirit [i.e., Gabriel] has brought it down","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":193,"sd":null},{"k":"26:194","t":"Upon your heart, [O Muḥammad] - that you may be of the warners -","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":194,"sd":null},{"k":"26:195","t":"In a clear Arabic language.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":195,"sd":null},{"k":"26:196","t":"And indeed, it is [mentioned] in the scriptures of former peoples.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":196,"sd":null},{"k":"26:197","t":"And has it not been a sign to them that it is recognized by the scholars of the Children of Israel?","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":197,"sd":null},{"k":"26:198","t":"And even if We had revealed it to one among the foreigners","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":198,"sd":null},{"k":"26:199","t":"And he had recited it to them [perfectly], they would [still] not have been believers in it.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":199,"sd":null},{"k":"26:200","t":"Thus have We inserted it [i.e., disbelief] into the hearts of the criminals.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":200,"sd":null},{"k":"26:201","t":"They will not believe in it until they see the painful punishment.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":201,"sd":null},{"k":"26:202","t":"And it will come to them suddenly while they perceive [it] not.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":202,"sd":null},{"k":"26:203","t":"And they will say, \"May we be reprieved?\"","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":203,"sd":null},{"k":"26:204","t":"So for Our punishment are they impatient?","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":204,"sd":null},{"k":"26:205","t":"Then have you considered if We gave them enjoyment for years","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":205,"sd":null},{"k":"26:206","t":"And then there came to them that which they were promised?","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":206,"sd":null}],"juz":19,"hizb":38,"surahs":[26],"sajdah":false}